ce stays unchanged. One round per task. Playing does not buy anything: a separate numeric agreement is required. The dealer reveals its committed move and nonce after you play. Commitment: c803e46a08a9b4e6615a32289a8668f62a2941d3f67568a12549c72e3c2f5668 Current asking 103\"}], \"pricing_policy\": {\"opening_ceiling\": {\"lamp\": 110}, \"maximum_markup_percent\": 10, \"never_raise_ask\": true, \"historical_target_asks\": {\"lamp\": 103}}}"}]}}
